---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageHead from '../components/PageHead.astro';
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How the Pathfinder pilot handles your data: no accounts, no tracking, and preferences stored only in your browser.">
  <PageHead eyebrow="Legal" title="Privacy" lede="The pilot collects as little as possible. Here is exactly what happens to your data." />
  <section class="section-tight">
    <div class="container prose">
      <h2>What the pilot stores</h2>
      <ul class="check-list">
        <li>No accounts, no sign-up, no analytics or advertising trackers.</li>
        <li>Your theme choice and daily question count are stored only in your own browser and never sent to us.</li>
        <li>Questions you ask are answered inside your browser from our published fact store. They are not sent to a server.</li>
        <li>The comparison and cost tools fetch public exchange rates from the European Central Bank feed (via Frankfurter), with no personal data attached.</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>When accounts launch</h2>
      <p>
        Accounts will come with consent capture, data export and deletion you can do yourself, and verifiable parental consent for
        users under 18. We are designing them to India’s Digital Personal Data Protection Act and Rules, GDPR and UK GDPR, and
        Singapore’s PDPA, among others. This page will be updated before any personal data is collected.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
